Package: speedtest-go
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser, init-system-helpers
Homepage: https://github.com/librespeed/speedtest-go
Description: Self-hosted speed test server (LibreSpeed Go backend)
 speedtest-go serves a JavaScript front end for download/upload/ping/jitter
 tests and can optionally record the results in a database (BoltDB, SQLite,
 PostgreSQL, MySQL or MSSQL). It is a single static binary with no runtime
 dependencies.
 .
 The package installs the server binary, a systemd unit, the configuration
 files in /etc/speedtest-go and the web assets in /usr/share/speedtest-go.
